//   means "close enough for the tablet to know the tool is there." The pen touching and lifting off
//   from the tablet while not leaving the area are handled by SDL_EVENT_PEN_DOWN and
//   SDL_EVENT_PEN_UP. Not all platforms have a window associated with the pen during proximity
